  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups uncooked brown rice",
    "4 cups water",
    "4 (15 ounce) cans black beans",
    "2 (15.5 ounce) cans pinto beans",
    "1 (10 ounce) can whole kernel corn",
    "1 (10 ounce) can diced tomatoes and green chiles",
    "16 (10 inch) flour tortillas",
    "1 pound shredded pepperjack cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RRYSO3ttHkLMw_YY-QMzWHkjcxo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/58246-make-ahead-lunch-wraps-DDMFS-step-01-fe290e727ca1467a99b04d97f128029d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58246/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine rice and water in a saucepan and bring to a boil. Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 35 to 40 minutes, or until tender. Remove from the heat and let and cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/v8stDcKWqET4RLf5Bvg4nqK9znI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/58246-make-ahead-lunch-wraps-DDMFS-step-02-4d744d5844c340f89d9787b73e1a0477.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58246/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, rinse black beans and pinto beans in a colander or strainer. Transfer beans to a large bowl. Mix in corn and diced tomatoes with green chiles, then mix in cooled rice and pepper Jack cheese.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/b_GAjiZ7XZ95HN6lQqonydQpIzo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/58246-make-ahead-lunch-wraps-DDMFS-step-03-e23924b948c2438aaf29eba7714ee7f4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58246/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide mixture evenly among tortillas and roll up.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5sdrv9f7Vgaj-2BmZ-sKYyPLidM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/58246-make-ahead-lunch-wraps-DDMFS-step-04-f20fe9aa0de1455ebfa150d710a6816d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58246/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wrap individually in plastic wrap, place into a large freezer bag, and freeze. Reheat as needed in the microwave for lunch or snacks.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/j9DsnqFU9dzv6Ne7w_90JKSQ5IU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/58246-make-ahead-lunch-wraps-DDMFS-step-05-5363524ff6004c788ab070f77dbd3138.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58246/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eqialk5XYhhxh-QbCVuyeWTUXX4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/58246-make-ahead-lunch-wraps-DDMFS-beauty-4x3-45398122cc6e4607b9f438a1c174f857.jpg"
